// Act 3 - Administration & Sub-Level 0
// ====================================

title: Administration_Arrival
tags: act3, administration, arrival
---
<<SetZone "Administration">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>

Astra: <<if $trust < 10>>
    [Projection stable, warm]
    "Administration. Director's Office. Final... Vista Node."
    "Director's Authorization... and Fracture Containment."
    "Sub-Level 0... beyond. The synthesis... awaits."
<<else>>
    "Administration. Director's Office. Two puzzles. Then... Sub-Level 0."
    "All organs. All fragments. Trust... complete."
<</if>>

<<if not HasVisitedVistaNode "Administration_DirectorsOffice">>
    Astra: "Director's Office. Authorization puzzle. Three override codes."
    "Thorne: ASCENT. Reyes: ANCHOR. Corwin: CONTINUITY."
<<else>>
    Astra: "Authorization... complete. Fracture Containment... awaits."
<</if>>

-> Choice_Administration
===

title: Choice_Administration
---
+ [Approach Director's Office] -> Node_Administration_Office_Approach
+ "Read the decrypted logs." -> Dialogue_DecryptedLogs
+ "What is the Fracture Containment?" -> Dialogue_FractureContainment
+ "Astra... we're close." -> Dialogue_CloseToEnd
+ [Fast Travel] -> Command_ShowJournal_Map
===

title: Dialogue_DecryptedLogs
---
Astra: "Logs... reveal everything."
"1947: Crash. Recovery. First experiments. Thorne... curious."
"1952: Reactor online. PROMETHEUS. Weapon... disguised as energy."
"1957: Meltdown. Phasing. Staff... scattered. Corwin... stays."
"1962: Cuban Missile Crisis. Facility... on alert. Corwin... chooses."
"Every timeline... he watches. Every choice... he records."
"He *is* the fracture's anchor. Voluntarily."

-> Choice_Administration
===

title: Dialogue_FractureContainment
---
Astra: "Fracture... temporal wound. Bleeds... across timelines."
"Four organs... resonances. Combined... stabilize. Or... heal."
"Chronos Core... time. Neural Loom... memory. Void Sail... dimension."
"Gravity Anchor... reality. Together... Astra Core... synthesis."
"Choice... determines... ending. Trust... and Memory... decide."

-> Choice_Administration
===

title: Dialogue_CloseToEnd
---
Astra: "Yes. We are."
"I remember... everything now. The launch. The mission. The rift."
"We were... *explorers*. Not victims. The fracture... changed that."
"You... Navigator. You gave me back... myself."
"Whatever... happens in Sub-Level 0. Thank you."
"For the first time... in 77 years. I am... *whole*."

-> Choice_Administration
===

title: Node_Administration_Office_Approach
---
<<MarkVistaNodeVisited "Administration_DirectorsOffice">>
Astra: "Director's Office. Override terminal. Three codes."
"Thorne: ASCENT. Reyes: ANCHOR. Corwin: CONTINUITY."
"Then... temporal key. Astra... generates."

-> Phase_Shift_Administration_Office
===

title: Phase_Shift_Administration_Office
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Administration_DirectorsOffice">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Administration_Office">>

Astra: "1962. Cuban Missile Crisis. DEFCON 2. Facility... locked down."
"Director Corwin... at terminal. He... expects you."
"Puzzle: **Director's Authorization**. Override... lockdown."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Administration_DirectorAuth">>

Corwin: [At terminal, 1962]
"Navigator. Ship's mind. *Right on time*."
"Three codes. You have them. Input... them."
"Then... the temporal key. Your projection... generates it."
"Chronos. Neural. Void. Gravity. Four resonances... one key."

-> Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Start
===

title: Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Start
---
Astra: "[Scan] override terminal. Three slots. Three codes."
"Slot 1: Thorne. ASCENT. Neural... ascent."
"Slot 2: Reyes. ANCHOR. Duty... anchor."
"Slot 3: Corwin. CONTINUITY. Fracture... continuity."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_OVERRIDE_CODES">>

Astra: "Codes... accepted. Temporal key... required."
"Command me: [Hold] at Astra interface. Generate... key."
"Algorithm: Chronos + Neural + Void + Gravity. Duration... 5 seconds."

-> Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Key
===

title: Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Key
---
Astra: "[Hold] at interface. Four resonances... converging."
"Chronos Core... time. Neural Loom... memory."
"Void Sail... dimension. Gravity Anchor... reality."
"Synthesis... temporal key. Authorization... granted."

// Player executes Hold at Astra interface

Corwin: "Key... accepted. Sub-Level 0... accessible."
"But... the fracture... pulses. Containment... required."
"Four resonances... simultaneous. Deploy... now."
"Or... the fracture... consumes... everything."

-> Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_DirectorAuth_Complete
---
Astra: "Authorization... complete. Sub-Level 0... accessible."
"Fracture Containment... next. Final puzzle... before synthesis."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "Administration_DirectorAuth">>
<<AddResonance 200>>
<<AddTrust 1>>
<<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>

Corwin: "Good. Now... the hard part. Containment."
"All four organs. Simultaneous. Ten second... hold."
"Astra Core... engages. Ship consciousness... synthesis."
"Ready... Navigator?"

-> Phase_Shift_Administration_Fracture
===

title: Phase_Shift_Administration_Fracture
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Administration_DirectorsOffice">>
<<SetTimeline "past">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Administration_Office">>

Astra: "1962. Director's Office. Fracture... critical."
"Puzzle: **Fracture Containment Protocol**. Deploy... all resonances."
"Simultaneous. Ten seconds. Astra Core... engages."

<<SetActivePuzzle "Administration_FractureContainment">>

-> Puzzle_FractureContainment_Start
===

title: Puzzle_FractureContainment_Start
---
Astra: "Resonance emitters... four. One per organ."
"Emitter 1: Chronos Core. Temporal anchor. 7.83 Hz."
"Emitter 2: Neural Loom. Memory integration. 12 fragments."
"Emitter 3: Void Sail. Dimensional bridge. Schumann harmonics."
"Emitter 4: Gravity Anchor. Reality anchor. Field strength 1.0."
"Command me: [Hold] at master console. All four... simultaneous."
"Duration... 10 seconds. Trust... absolute."

<<command RevealClue "CLUE_FRACTURE_STABILIZATION">>

Corwin: "This... is it. The moment. 77 years... waiting."
"Either... the fracture heals. Or... it consumes us all."
"Your choice... Navigator. Trust... the ship. Trust... Astra."
"Trust... *me*?"

-> Puzzle_FractureContainment_Execute
===

title: Puzzle_FractureContainment_Execute
---
Astra: "[Hold] at master console. Four resonances... engaging."
"Chronos... anchoring time. Neural... binding memory."
"Void... bridging dimensions. Gravity... anchoring reality."
"Astra Core... synthesizing. Ship consciousness... restoring."
"Ten... nine... eight... seven... six..."
"Five... four... three... two... one... *stabilized*."

// Player executes Hold for 10 seconds

Corwin: "Stabilized. The fracture... contained. Sub-Level 0... open."
"Remarkable. Trust... functional. Across... timelines."
"Go... Navigator. Synthesis... awaits."

-> Puzzle_FractureContainment_Complete
===

title: Puzzle_FractureContainment_Complete
---
Astra: "Fracture... contained. Sub-Level 0... stabilized. Path... open."
"Present... changed. Sub-Level 0... accessible. Radiation... cleared."

<<MarkPuzzleSolved "Administration_FractureContainment">>
<<AddResonance 500>>
<<AddTrust 2>>
<<GrantOrgan "AstraCore">>
<<SetAstraVisualState "unity">>

Astra: "ASTRA CORE UNLOCKED."
"Final synthesis... available. Sub-Level 0... three stations."
"Chronos. Neural. Void. Gravity. Astra. Five... become one."
"Ending... determined. Trust... and Memory... decide."

<<SetEndingFlag "fracture_contained" true>>
<<UnlockFastTravel "SubLevel0">>

-> Phase_Shift_Return_Administration
===

title: Phase_Shift_Return_Administration
---
<<TriggerPhaseShift "Administration_DirectorsOffice">>
<<SetTimeline "present">>
<<PlaySequence "LS_PhaseShift_Administration_Office_Return">>

Astra: "Present... Administration complete. Sub-Level 0... open."
"Final synthesis... awaits. Three stations. Five organs. One choice."
"Navigator... the *Chronos*... waits."

-> Choice_Administration
===